{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12114380","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12114380","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1211438001:1":{"text":"바다를 지배하려다 결국 바다에 집어삼켜 졌군...","source_cn":"妄图掌控海洋，却最终被海洋吞没……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F710E4EA2AA2E9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211438002:1":{"text":"호드킨에게 가장 잘 어울리는 꼴사나운 결말이야.","source_cn":"多么可笑的结局，倒是与他相配。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x884DD9508589C45C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211438003:0":{"text":"그만! 호드킨을 위해 슬퍼할 시간 따윈 없다고!","source_cn":"打住！我们可没空替他伤感！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC184BE9FA434537A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211438004:1":{"text":"신밧드, 어서 이곳을 떠나야 해! 침몰한 불사호 때문에 소용돌이가 일어날 거야. 우리까지 말려들어 갈 순 없어!","source_cn":"辛巴达，得赶紧远离这里！不死号沉没会形成虹吸的漩涡，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F47F7993AB58B97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211438005:1":{"text":"알겠어!","source_cn":"知道了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93C37180AFEA4968","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_